      "rationale": "The local candidate and exact timeout contract are tested, while commit-bound CI, publication, v0.8.2 installed activation, an actionable automatic continuation, and Claude runtime invocation remain separate gates.",
      "statement": "On this Windows host, the local v0.8.2 candidate ran 230 repository tests: 229 passed and one privilege-dependent generic symlink test was skipped. It passed the official skill and plugin validators, replayed the offline quality-loop conformance fixture without outbound action, and verified its package and embedded engine. A focused regression requires the single Codex Stop hook to use an exact five-second timeout. The preceding live v0.8.1 activation invoked a compatible producer and the Stop hook but timed out, so successful v0.8.2 installed continuation remains unobserved.",
      "status": "partially_supported"
    }
  ],
